WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.780
This year, the rains failed

2
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.550
Guatemala’s Dry Corridor.

3
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.190
NASA satellites have watched

4
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.750
this land for two decades,

5
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.450
one pixel at a time.

6
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.110
Milpa Resiliente turns

7
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.770
those pixels into three facts

8
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.100
a farmer can see,

9
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.000
and hear.

10
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:15.500
Site audio: “Soil: watch.”

11
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.800
Thirty-three NASA climate futures.

12
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.950
Today’s crops hold in nine.

13
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.270
Short-cycle maize,

14
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.450
in all thirty-three.

15
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.750
Same evidence,

16
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:24.610
so the farmer

17
00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:25.870
and the extension worker

18
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:26.900
decide together.
